//! stage:typing no-std
// Expected after the change: accepted, in every order of the top-level declarations.
// Reason: Copy of Tests/CompilerTests/positive/self-where-clause.hylo (`Self` in the extension's own where clause).
// Currently: base accepts it in all 6 orders tried; FULL accepts it in all 6 orders tried.
trait P {}
trait Q<U> {}

struct S<T, U> {}

// These ones type check because `Self` occurs after `T` and `U`.
extension <T, U where Self is P> S<T, U> {}
extension <T, U is Q<Self>> S<T, U> {}

// This one type checks because `Self` occurs after `T` and `U` in the desugared where-clause.
extension <T is Q<Self>, U> S<T, U> {}
